  "id": "standing-rib-roast",
  "name": "Standing Rib Roast",
  "subtitle": "Coffee-brined beef roast with savory onion seasoning",
  "description": "A six-pound standing rib roast is brined with coffee, aromatics, and savory seasonings, then slow-roasted and finished in a hot oven.",
